0..75 Comment "// A buffer type or a web written with no import of its home names no type."
76..78 Comment "//"
79..154 Comment "// `Buf` and `Web` live in `std.buffer`, and the ambient scope answers them"
155..231 Comment "// nowhere. A source that names one lists it, as it lists any other module\'s"
232..240 Comment "// name."
241..243 Comment "//"
244..319 Comment "// The source writes each without `import std.buffer (Buf, Web);`, and each"
320..364 Comment "// type head is refused where it is written."
365..367 Comment "//"
